  "name": "Formal Noodle Suit",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-sword-gray.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a bonus action, you can choose to consume an entire bag of flour to form a suit of armor out of Ramen. You gain the following benefits while wearing this suit:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You gain twice your level in temporary hit points.</li>\n<li>Your Noodle Strike attacks have a bonus to their attack and damage rolls equal to half your proficiency bonus, rounded up.</li>\n<li>As a reaction to being hit by a melee attack, you can force the attacker to make a Strength Saving throw, DC = 8 + your Strength Modifier + Proficiency Bonus. On a failure, that creature becomes restrained, escape DC is also the same.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This suit lasts 24 hours, or until you lose all your temporary hit points. You can use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, per long rest.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
